      "type": "point",
      "kicker": "Web Development",
      "heading": "Step 5: Run the OAuth flow once",
      "body": "Build the authorization URL with your client ID, redirect URI, state, and the scopes above. Sign in and consent on LinkedIn.",
      "durationInFrames": 330
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "kicker": "Web Development",
      "heading": "Step 6: Store the token securely",
      "body": "Do not commit the client secret or the access token to a repository. Store the access token as a GitHub Actions secret (I name mine LINKEDINTOKEN).",
      "durationInFrames": 330
    },
